            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "just_jam"
            },
            "reviewBody": "super tasty.. perfect combo of salty and sweet.. i left out the basil and onion and reduced the olive oil to 2 T.. i blended the lime juice, balsamic vinegar and olive oil with a thick slice of onion and a clove of garlic before adding to the salad.. thinking about taking this up to bf's parents next time we visit.. ty for the recipe",
            "datePublished": "2017-09-10T18:56:17.083Z"
          },
