              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "April Backus"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was a delicious summer salad. We had it for Father's day brunch and my dad said it was tasty and refreshing on a hot summer day. It would even be a great salsa for fish tacos. A couple of suggestions would be to keep it nice and cold and use a slotted spoon for serving.",
