            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "HiRollerette"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was delightful! I omitted the cilantro and mint, only because I didn’t have any, and I substituted the Feta with Cotija cheese instead because I thought that the saltiness of the cheese would pair nicely with the sweetness of the watermelon and the tanginess of the balsamic vinaigrette. I used pickled red onions that I had in hand and will definitely be making this again!",
            "datePublished": "2026-07-23T20:48:02.566Z"
          },
          {
