            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "France C"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This salad is super refreshing during those hot summer months. The only thing I don't like is how much liquid is released into the bowl if it sits. I also didn't really like it as much the next day, so I suggest making it right before you need it and only make enough so there's no leftovers.",
